# mariadb option addon (D31): the MariaDB client library and tools the app
# needs (the mysql2 gem builds against libmariadb; mariadb, mariadb-dump for
# db tasks). MariaDB speaks MySQL's protocol: a MySQL app uses it as is.
ARG BASE_IMAGE
FROM ${BASE_IMAGE}
USER root
RUN apt-get update -qq && \
  apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends libmariadb-dev mariadb-client && \
  rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*
USER appuser
